d in our servers, systems or devices, in the servers, systems or devices of our third party service providers or collaborators, or on your device, and may be used by us or our third party service providers or collaborators to facilitate your access or use of the Service. We or our third party service providers or collaborators may collect system configuration information and/or traffic information (such as an IP address) and/or use information or statistical information to operate, maintain or improve the Services or the underlying service of the third party service provider or collaborator. For the avoidance of doubt, in this Privacy Policy, a reference to a third party service provider or collaborator includes other third parties who provide a service or collaborate with our third party service provider or collaborator."}),(0,l.jsx)("p",{children:"If you provide us with personally identifiable data:"}),(0,l.jsx)("p",{children:"We may use, disclose and process the data for any one or more of the following purposes:"}),(0,l.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,l.jsx)("b",{children:"4.1."})," to assist, process and facilitate your access or use of the Service;"]}),(0,l.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,l.jsx)("b",{children:"4.2."})," to administer, process and facilitate any transactions or activities by you, whether with us or any other Public Sector Entity or third party service provider or collaborator, and whether for your own benefit, or for the benefit of a third party on whose behalf you are duly authorised to act;"]}),(0,l.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,l.jsx)("b",{children:"4.3."})," to carry out your instructions or respond to any queries, feedback or complaints provided by (or purported to be provided by) you or on your behalf, or otherwise for the purposes of responding to or dealing with your interactions with us;"]}),(0,l.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,l.jsx)("b",{children:"4.4."})," to monitor and track your usage of the Service or our websites, to conduct research, data analytics, survey